    <div class="itdgl-li-intro">
      <p>LinkedIn is the highest-intent professional network for B2B Manufacturing, Industrial + Engineering Exports professionals in Delhi NCR, Delhi + Haryana + UP. B2B manufacturing is where LinkedIn actually converts to purchase orders. Global buyers + procurement heads + tender committees research suppliers on LinkedIn before RFQ shortlist. Manufacturing SMEs win Rs 5-50 crore orders via LinkedIn-attributed BD. 50+ lakh LinkedIn members across NCR. Very dense in consulting (Big-4 + Kearney + Bain + BCG regional offices), VC (Peak XV + Sequoia + Elevation), government-affairs + policy, IT services (Infosys/Wipro/HCL BPO towers) Delhi/NCR buyer relationship-driven + values access + government-adjacent networks. LinkedIn used heavily for BD + policy + industry-body engagement. Consulting-hub feeder market.</p><p>Personal Branding on LinkedIn typically requires: About Us + profile optimisation, banner + headline + featured section, weekly content (posts + articles + video + Reels), engagement + community management, thought-leadership positioning, Creator Mode setup, newsletter, LinkedIn Live. This FAQ answers 12 questions MD/CEO of manufacturing SME, Plant Head, VP Sales, Export Manager, Business Development Head, Second-generation family-business scion professionals in Delhi NCR ask about hiring ITD GrowthLabs to run their LinkedIn LinkedIn Personal Branding for Professionals + Founders + CXOs.</p>
